  "createdAt" : 1785242116,
  "description" : "The Massachusetts Department of Early Education and Care (EEC) supports access to child care and out-of-school time programs by providing Child Care Financial Assistance (CCFA) to eligible families. This dataset includes the number of unique children served by EEC's CCFA program by month, based on CCFA billing data. The data include disaggregations by age group, region, funding source, agreement type, and provider type. Note that children can be served across multiple categories, but all totals are deduplicated and represent a count of unique children.  Therefore, instead of summing across categories, users should use the filters to select specific disaggregations. The billing data for a given month may be updated as additional providers submit their billing information. Categories with fewer than 10 children billed are not included.\nThis dataset is part of <a href=\"https://app.powerbigov.us/view?r=eyJrIjoiZmNlNjUwMmEtYzM1NC00OGU2LWIyYWQtMzg1MDk2MmE3MDJkIiwidCI6IjNlODYxZDE2LTQ4YjctNGEwZS05ODA2LThjMDRkODFiN2IyYSJ9&pageName=9949865fcf248b434d7d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">EEC's Key Performance Indicator (KPI) Dashboard</a>.",
